# ── Build trees ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Per-preset build/<name>/ dirs, the test-matrix scratch trees under
# build/matrix/, and vendored in-source build/ dirs (a bare pattern
# matches a directory of that name at every level; [Bb] covers both
# casings in one line).
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uild-*/

# ── CMake in-source configure artifacts ─────────────────────────────
# Only produced if you ever configure without -B; normal builds live
# under build/ (ignored above). CMakeUserPresets.json is the local
# developer overlay (personal Ninja/generator choices) and is never
# committed; CMakePresets.json holds the shared presets.
CMakeUserPresets.json
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
install_manifest.txt
[Mm]akefile
CTestTestfile.cmake
DartConfiguration.tcl
Testing/
*.ninja
.ninja_*

# ── Compiled objects & dependency files ─────────────────────────────
# -MD dependency outputs (*.d) sit next to objects on in-source builds.
*.o
*.obj
*.slo
*.lo
*.d

# ── Precompiled headers ─────────────────────────────────────────────
*.gch
*.pch

# ── Libraries (static & shared) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Compiler outputs only; already-tracked files (e.g. under external/)
# stay tracked — gitignore never untracks.
*.a
*.lib
*.la
*.lai
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib
*.dll

# ── Executables ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.exe
*.out
*.app

# ── Linker & debug-symbol artifacts ─────────────────────────────────
# MSVC (*.ilk, *.pdb), GCC split-DWARF (*.dwo).
*.ilk
*.pdb
*.dwo

# ── Other toolchain artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────
# Fortran modules (upstream template parity; no Fortran in this tree).
*.mod
*.smod

# ── Runtime-generated files ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Created by the app on first startup/run; never commit these. The
# checked-in samples (configs/app.{json,toml,xml,yaml}) stay tracked.
configs/app.conf
configs/version.conf
data/
logs/
*.log

# ── Editor & temporary leftovers ────────────────────────────────────
# Local VS Code overlays mirroring CMakeUserPresets.json
.vscode/*.user.json
compile_commands.json
*~
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
.DS_Store

# ── Package-manager & cache directories ─────────────────────────────
vcpkg_installed/
.cache/

# ── Local archives & scratch ────────────────────────────────────────
archives/

# ── Local agent configuration & generated knowledge graph ───────────
.agents/
.codex/
.claude/
.serena/
graphify-out/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

